    "faq.vaultFor.a": "Values your tools and agents read by name: tokens, passwords, settings. Add a value your tools or agents should read by name; you can encrypt it with a password first. The list does not show values. In an entry, the value is read only when you press Show value or Copy, and is removed from the page when you hide it or close the entry.",
