  "pages/billing/strings.en.json": {
    "buy.accountChanged": "You signed in to a different account in another Hub. Nothing was charged. Quit the Hub and start it again to continue.",
    "buy.adopted": "Nothing was sent: another Hub already sent a request for this and its outcome is unknown. Check that request, then confirm again.",
    noLocks: "This device can't stop two Hubs from sending the same payment twice. Pay from the Hub on the web.",
    "buy.storeErr": "Nothing was sent: this device couldn't save the request, which is what keeps it from ever being charged twice. Check that no other Hub is open for this account, then try again.",
    "mkt.posting": "Charging your wallet — don't quit the Hub.",
    "mkt.reserveNewBody": "The earlier reservation may already have gone through, so a new one could charge you twice. The Hub won't send the earlier request again.",
    "mkt.reserveNewBodyTerm": "The earlier {{days}}-day reservation may already have gone through, so a new one could charge you twice. The Hub won't send it again.",
    "mkt.reserveNewKept": "This device still keeps an earlier {{days}}-day reservation of this server, so nothing new was started. Check that one first.",
    "mkt.reserveNewStoreErr": "This device couldn't stop tracking the earlier reservation, so nothing new was started. Check it, or try again.",
    "mkt.reserveNoLocks": "This device can't stop two Hubs from sending this reservation twice, so it can't send it again or start a new one here. Check it, or use the Hub on the web.",
    "mkt.storageFailed": "This device couldn't save the safety record this reservation needs, so nothing was sent and you were not charged. Check that no other Hub is open for this account, then try again.",
    "subs.accountChanged": "You signed in to a different account in another Hub, so nothing here was loaded or changed. Quit the Hub and start it again to continue.",
    "band.notSaved": "This device would not save this, so only this Hub remembers it: keep it open until you have checked.",
    "top.notSaved": "Keep this Hub open until you have checked. This device would not save this payment, so only this Hub remembers it.",
    "band.forgetRefused": "Couldn't stop tracking it. It is still being sent, or another Hub changed it. Check again first.",
    "faq.retrySafe.a": "When the Hub can't confirm a purchase, payment or upgrade, it asks you to check first (Servers for a purchase). Send the same request again repeats that request, so it is never charged twice. A rental is different: Check again on an unconfirmed rental only reads it back, and renting again anyway can give you two servers and two charges. Start a new purchase on an unconfirmed reservation can charge twice too. The Hub asks you to confirm both first. If this device can't save a new request, it is not sent; if it can't stop two Hubs paying twice, the Hub asks you to pay on the web."
  },
